flowchart TD
  L[Source-quoted limitations<br/>and prior art] --> I[Ideas and<br/>grounded novelty]
  I --> E[Staged experiments<br/>named baselines and protocol]
  E --> S[Evidence-bound<br/>selection]
  S --> A[Ablation and<br/>attribution]
  A --> R[Review rounds<br/>and evaluator provenance]
  R --> B[Rebuttal and<br/>human revision]
  B --> R
  E --> P[Provenance audit<br/>integrity arms and rollup]
  A --> P
  R --> P
  P -. evidence and missing checks .-> H[Human judgment<br/>no automatic promotion]
  classDef stage fill:#eef2ff,stroke:#6366f1,color:#312e81
  classDef audit fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
  classDef human fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#f97316,color:#7c2d12
  class L,I,E,S,A,R,B stage
  class P audit
  class H human
